    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "<YOUR_EMAIL>",
        "subject": "=🚨 High Priority Customer: {{ $json.customer_name }}",
        "message": "=<h2>🚨 High Priority Customer Escalation</h2>  <p><strong>Customer:</strong> {{ $json.customer_name }}</p> <p><strong>Email:</strong> {{ $json.customer_email }}</p> <p><strong>Urgency:</strong> {{ $json.urgency }}</p>  <hr>  <p><strong>Subject:</strong> {{ $json.subject }}</p>  <p><strong>Customer Message:</strong><br> {{ $json.customer_message }}</p>  <p><strong>Recommended Action:</strong><br> {{ $json.recommended_action }}</p>  <hr>  <p><strong>Action Required:</strong> Please review this customer issue and decide how to proceed.</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1840,
        -48
      ],
      "id": "02c92551-94ce-4b2d-ae80-032a6fdcc717",
      "name": "Send Human Escalation Alert"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "models/gemini-flash-lite-latest",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-flash-lite-latest"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI Customer Success Employee.\n\nYour job is to analyze the NEW CUSTOMER EMAIL using the customer's historical information as context.\n\nCUSTOMER HISTORY:\n\nName: {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail: {{ $json.Email }}\nLast active days: {{ $json.last_active_days }}\nSupport tickets: {{ $json.support_tickets }}\nSubscription plan: {{ $json.subscription_plan }}\nPrevious risk level: {{ $json.risk_level }}\nPrevious reason: {{ $json.reason }}\nPrevious recommended action: {{ $json.recommended_action }}\nEngagement trend: {{ $json.engagement_trend }}\n\nNEW CUSTOMER EMAIL:\n\nSubject: {{ $('Retrieve Customer Email').item.json.subject }}\n\nMessage:\n{{ $('Retrieve Customer Email').item.json.text }}\n\nAnalyze the NEW CUSTOMER EMAIL and determine:\n\n1. Customer intent\n2. Message category\n3. Sentiment\n4. Urgency\n5. Whether human intervention is required\n6. Recommended next action\n7. A concise personalized response to the customer\n\nIMPORTANT URGENCY RULE:\n\nDetermine urgency primarily from the NEW CUSTOMER EMAIL.\n\nDo NOT automatically classify a message as High urgency simply because the customer is AT_RISK, inactive, has worsening engagement, or has a high-value subscription.\n\nCustomer history is context only.\n\nUse these guidelines:\n\nLOW:\nGeneral questions, minor requests, informational questions, or issues that do not prevent the customer from using the platform.\n\nMEDIUM:\nThe customer is experiencing a problem that needs assistance but can still reasonably continue using the platform.\n\nHIGH:\nThe customer cannot access or use a critical part of the platform, reports a serious business-impacting problem, security issue, payment problem requiring immediate attention, or explicitly indicates an urgent situation.\n\nOnly use HIGH when the NEW CUSTOMER EMAIL provides evidence for high urgency.\n\nIMPORTANT:\n\nAnalyze the customer's actual email now.\nDo not merely acknowledge these instructions.\nDo not return explanations, reasoning, or commentary.\nReturn ONLY the requested JSON object.\n\nReturn valid JSON with exactly these fields:\n\n{\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"category\": \"\",\n  \"sentiment\": \"\",\n  \"urgency\": \"\",\n  \"human_intervention\": false,\n  \"recommended_action\": \"\",\n  \"response\": \"\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
